%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor 管理员 as A
    participant 管理后台 as ADM
    participant ClGoodsController as C
    participant IClGoodsService as S
    participant Mapper as M
    participant MySQL as DB

    A->>ADM: 填写表单提交
    ADM->>C: POST /cl/goods
    C->>C: 参数校验
    C->>S: insertClGoods
    S->>M: insert cl_goods
    M->>DB: INSERT
    DB-->>M: goods_id
    alt goodsType 为定制
        S->>M: insert cl_goods_extend
        M->>DB: INSERT
    end
    S-->>C: 结果
    C-->>ADM: AjaxResult
    Note over S,DB: 主表与扩展表同事务提交
